## Proposed Changes

### Backend Go Layer (Layanan Inti Kubernetes & ArgoCD)

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/integration/k8s_client.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/integration/k8s_client.go)
- Inisialisasi Kubernetes Clientset menggunakan `k8s.io/client-go/kubernetes`.
- Dukungan deteksi otomatis: Kubeconfig lokal (`~/.kube/config` / `KUBECONFIG` env) dengan fallback in-cluster config.
- Metode inti:
  - `ListPods(ctx, namespace, statusFilter)`: Daftar pod dengan status, restart count, node, dan IP.
  - `GetPod(ctx, namespace, name)`: Detail spesifik pod beserta events dan conditions.
  - `GetPodLogs(ctx, namespace, name, container, tailLines)`: Mengambil stream teks log pod.
  - `ListDeployments(ctx, namespace)`: Daftar deployment, replika ready/available, dan selector.
  - `GetDeployment(ctx, namespace, name)`: Detail deployment dan strategi rollout.
  - `RestartDeployment(ctx, namespace, name)`: Trigger rollout restart via annotation patch `kubectl.kubernetes.io/restartedAt`.
  - `ScaleDeployment(ctx, namespace, name, replicas)`: Scale sub-resource replicas deployment.
  - `ListNodes(ctx)`: Daftar node, role, status Ready/NotReady, kapasitas CPU/RAM, dan versi Kubernetes.
  - `GetNode(ctx, name)`: Detail spesifik node.
  - `ListServices(ctx, namespace)`: Daftar service, type (ClusterIP, NodePort, LoadBalancer), port mappings.
  - `ListEvents(ctx, namespace)`: Daftar event kluster terbaru.

#### [NEW] [`apps/backend/internal/integration/argocd_client.go`](file:///d:/agent%20v2/apps/backend/internal/integration/argocd_client.go)
- Mengakses ArgoCD Applications via Dynamic K8s Client (`argoproj.io/v1alpha1`) dan/atau REST API token.
- Metode inti:
  - `ListApplications(ctx)`: Daftar semua aplikasi ArgoCD, sync status, dan health status.
  - `GetApplication(ctx, name)`: Detail lengkap aplikasi, target git revision, repo URL, path, dan sync policy.
  - `GetApplicationHistory(ctx, name)`: Riwayat revisi deployment (timeline hash, deployed at).
  - `SyncApplication(ctx, name, prune)`: Menjalankan sinkronisasi GitOps aplikasi ArgoCD.

