## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. **Backend Unit Tests**:
   - `go test ./internal/service -run "TestKubernetes" -v`
   - `go test ./internal/service -run "TestArgoCD" -v`
   - `go test ./...` (memastikan 100% lulus tanpa regresi)
2. **Frontend Unit Tests**:
   - `npm test` di `apps/frontend` (Vitest test suite)
3. **Production Build Verification**:
   - `npm run build` di `apps/frontend` (Next.js Turbopack typecheck & static page generation)
   - `scripts/build-linux.ps1` (Cross-compile Linux binary)

### Manual & Runtime Verification
1. **Live K3d Data Inspection**:
   - Verifikasi endpoint `GET /api/v1/kubernetes/pods` mengembalikan pods nyata (`k3s`, `argocd`, `sample-nginx`, `sample-httpbin`).
   - Verifikasi endpoint `GET /api/v1/kubernetes/nodes` mengembalikan 3 node nyata (`k3d-cifo-dev-server-0`, `agent-0`, `agent-1`).
2. **ArgoCD Live API Verification**:
   - Verifikasi endpoint `GET /api/v1/argocd/applications` menampilkan aplikasi `sample-nginx-app` dan `sample-httpbin-app`.
3. **Write Operations & RBAC Verification**:
   - Uji scale deployment via `PUT /api/v1/kubernetes/deployments/default/sample-nginx/scale` (ubah replika dari 2 -> 3).
   - Uji restart deployment via `POST /api/v1/kubernetes/deployments/default/sample-nginx/restart`.
   - Uji trigger sync ArgoCD via `POST /api/v1/argocd/applications/sample-nginx-app/sync`.
   - Verifikasi entri baru di tabel `audit_log`.
4. **UI Walkthrough**:
   - Buka browser ke `http://localhost:3001/kubernetes` dan `http://localhost:3001/argocd`.
   - Pastikan visual tab, badge warna, dan modal detail berjalan mulus dengan dark mode.

